      "raw_text": "[4:30PM]\n #Marina\n #TrafficUpdate\n\nLarge turnout of vehicles and pedestrians attending an event at Mobolaji Johnson Arena has led to significant  congestion along King George IV road, Onikan roundabout. backlog of traffic has gone back to  Bonny camp. \n\nMovement from zone 2 underneath the bridge is also slow due to alternation at the intersection. \n\nOfficers strategically positioned managing the resultant effect of the event.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@lagostraffic961 \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@trafficbutter \n@trafficpalava",
      "cleaned_text": "[4:30PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate Large turnout of vehicles and pedestrians attending an event at Mobolaji Johnson Arena has led to significant congestion along King George IV road, Onikan roundabout. backlog of traffic has gone back to Bonny camp. Movement from zone 2 underneath the bridge is also slow due to alternation at the intersection. Officers strategically positioned managing the resultant effect of the event. #FollowLASTMA",
      "english_translation": "[4:30PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate Large turnout of vehicles and pedestrians attending an event at Mobolaji Johnson Arena has led to significant congestion along King George IV road, Onikan roundabout. backlog of traffic has gone back to Bonny camp. Movement from zone 2 underneath the bridge is also slow due to alternation at the intersection. Officers strategically positioned managing the resultant effect of the event. #FollowLASTMA",
